{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_015","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"A SignerList entry represents a list of parties that, as a group, are authorized to sign a transaction in place of an individual account by multi-signing . You can create, replace, or remove a signer list using a SignerListSet transaction .","location_hint":"paragraph 141","char_start":2769,"char_end":3009,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
