{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_017","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"{\n\"Flags\" : 0 ,\n\"LedgerEntryType\" : \"SignerList\" ,\n\"OwnerNode\" : \"0000000000000000\" ,\n\"PreviousTxnID\" : \"5904C0DC72C58A83AEFED2FFC5386356AA83FCA6A88C89D00646E51E687CDBE4\" ,\n\"PreviousTxnLgrSeq\" : 16061435 ,\n\"SignerEntries\" : [\n{\n\"SignerEntry\" : {\n\"Account\" : \"rsA2LpzuawewSBQXkiju3YQTMzW13pAAdW\" ,\n\"SignerWeight\" : 2\n}\n},\n{\n\"SignerEntry\" : {\n\"Account\" : \"raKEEVSGnKSD9Zyvxu4z6Pqpm4ABH8FS6n\" ,\n\"SignerWeight\" : 1\n}\n},\n{\n\"SignerEntry\" : {\n\"Account\" : \"rUpy3eEg8rqjqfUoLeBnZkscbKbFsKXC3v\" ,\n\"SignerWeight\" : 1\n}\n}\n],\n\"SignerListID\" : 0 ,\n\"SignerQuorum\" : 3 ,\n\"index\" : \"A9C28A28B85CD533217F5C0A0C7767666B093FA58A0F2D80026FCC4CD932DDC7\"\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 144","char_start":3087,"char_end":3720,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_018","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"In addition to the common fields , SignerList entries have the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 146","char_start":3741,"char_end":3821,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_019","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"Name JSON Type Internal Type Required? Description","location_hint":"paragraph 147","char_start":3825,"char_end":3875,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_020","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"OwnerNode String UInt64 Yes A hint indicating which page of the owner directory links to this object, in case the directory consists of multiple pages.","location_hint":"paragraph 148","char_start":3879,"char_end":4030,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_021","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"PreviousTxnID String UInt256 Yes The identifying hash of the transaction that most recently modified this object.","location_hint":"paragraph 149","char_start":4032,"char_end":4145,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_022","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"PreviousTxnLgrSeq Number UInt32 Yes The index of the ledger that contains the transaction that most recently modified this object.","location_hint":"paragraph 150","char_start":4147,"char_end":4277,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_023","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"SignerEntries Array Array Yes An array of Signer Entry objects representing the parties who are part of this signer list.","location_hint":"paragraph 151","char_start":4279,"char_end":4400,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_024","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"SignerListID Number UInt32 Yes An ID for this signer list. Currently always set to 0 . If a future amendment allows multiple signer lists for an account, this may change.","location_hint":"paragraph 152","char_start":4402,"char_end":4572,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_025","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"SignerQuorum Number UInt32 Yes A target number for signer weights. To produce a valid signature for the owner of this SignerList, the signers must provide valid signatures whose weights sum to this value or more.","location_hint":"paragraph 153","char_start":4574,"char_end":4786,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_026","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"The SignerEntries may be any combination of funded and unfunded addresses that use either secp256k1 or ed25519 keys.","location_hint":"paragraph 154","char_start":4790,"char_end":4906,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_027","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"Each member of the SignerEntries field is an object that describes that signer in the list. A Signer Entry has the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 156","char_start":4929,"char_end":5061,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_028","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"Name JSON Type Internal Type Description","location_hint":"paragraph 157","char_start":5065,"char_end":5105,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_029","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"Account String AccountID An XRP Ledger address whose signature contributes to the multi-signature. It does not need to be a funded address in the ledger.","location_hint":"paragraph 158","char_start":5109,"char_end":5262,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_030","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"SignerWeight Number UInt16 The weight of a signature from this signer. A multi-signature is only valid if the sum weight of the signatures provided meets or exceeds the signer list&#x27;s SignerQuorum value.","location_hint":"paragraph 159","char_start":5264,"char_end":5471,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_031","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"WalletLocator String UInt256 (Optional) Arbitrary hexadecimal data. This can be used to identify the signer or for other, related purposes.","location_hint":"paragraph 160","char_start":5473,"char_end":5612,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_032","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"Requires the ExpandedSignerList amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 161","char_start":5614,"char_end":5668,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_033","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"When processing a multi-signed transaction, the server looks up the Account values with respect to the ledger at the time of transaction execution. If the address does not correspond to a funded AccountRoot ledger entry , then only the master private key associated with that address can be used to produce a valid signature. If the account does exist in the ledger, then it depends on the state of that account. If the account has a Regular Key configured, the Regular Key can be used. The account&#x27;s master key can only be used if it is not disabled. A multi-signature cannot be used as part of another multi-signature.","location_hint":"paragraph 162","char_start":5674,"char_end":6299,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_034","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"SignerList entries can have the following value in the Flags field:","location_hint":"paragraph 164","char_start":6319,"char_end":6386,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_035","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"Flag Name Hex Value Decimal Value Description","location_hint":"paragraph 165","char_start":6390,"char_end":6435,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_036","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"lsfOneOwnerCount 0x00010000 65536 If this flag is enabled, this SignerList counts as one item for purposes of the owner reserve . Otherwise, this list counts as N+2 items, where N is the number of signers it contains. This flag is automatically enabled if you add or update a signer list after the MultiSignReserve amendment is enabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 166","char_start":6439,"char_end":6775,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_037","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"Requires the MultiSignReserve amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 167","char_start":6779,"char_end":6831,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_038","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"A signer list contributes to its owner&#x27;s reserve requirement . Removing the signer list frees up the reserve.","location_hint":"paragraph 169","char_start":6860,"char_end":6974,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_039","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"Requires the MultiSignReserve . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 170","char_start":6976,"char_end":7018,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_040","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"made it so each signer list counts as one item, regardless of how many members it has. As a result, the owner reserve for any signer list added or updated after this time is 0.2 XRP .","location_hint":"paragraph 171","char_start":7020,"char_end":7203,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_041","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"A signer list created before the MultiSignReserve amendment counts as two items towards the owner reserve, plus one for each member of the list. As a result, the total owner reserve associated with an old signer list is anywhere from 3 times to 10 times as much as a new signer list. To update a signer list to use the new, reduced reserve, update the signer list by sending a SignerListSet transaction .","location_hint":"paragraph 172","char_start":7205,"char_end":7609,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_042","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"The ID of a SignerList entry is the SHA-512Half of the following values, concatenated in order:","location_hint":"paragraph 174","char_start":7633,"char_end":7728,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_043","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"The RippleState space key ( 0x0053 )","location_hint":"paragraph 175","char_start":7732,"char_end":7768,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_044","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"The AccountID of the owner of the signer list","location_hint":"paragraph 176","char_start":7770,"char_end":7815,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_045","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"The SignerListID (currently always 0 )","location_hint":"paragraph 177","char_start":7817,"char_end":7855,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_68a1f3f26f9b_046","source_id":"src_68a1f3f26f9b","source_hash":"c04e14ca248e9abd9ad1c164d453c204d9db244fcc6b40c4cedf0ae36f9d42dd","text":"Example SignerList JSON SignerList Fields Signer Entry Object SignerList Flags Signer Lists and Reserves SignerList ID Format See Also","location_hint":"paragraph 188","char_start":8059,"char_end":8193,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:58:17.476Z"}
